{"path":"header/typeindex","title":"Standard library header <typeindex> (C++11)","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">Standard library header</span> &lt;typeindex&gt;&nbsp;<span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/header/typeindex","section":"header","kind":"page","summary":"This header is part of the type support library.","html":"<p>This header is part of the <a href=\"/w/cpp/types\">type support</a> library.\n</p>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <h3 id=\"Includes\">Includes</h3>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/compare\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>&lt;compare&gt;</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(C++20)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td> <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/operator_comparison#Three-way_comparison\">Three-way comparison operator</a> support</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <h3 id=\"Classes\">Classes</h3>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/type_index\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>type_index</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  wrapper around a <code>type_info</code> object, that can be used as index in associative and unordered associative containers <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(class)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/type_index/hash\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>std::hash<span class=\"t-dsc-small\">&lt;std::type_index&gt;</span></span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  hash support for <a href=\"/w/cpp/types/type_index\"><code>std::type_index</code></a> <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(class template specialization)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <h5 id=\"Forward_declarations\">Forward declarations </h5>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/functional\">&lt;functional&gt;</a></code> </div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/hash\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>hash</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  hash function object <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(class template)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Synopsis\">Synopsis</h3>\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;compare&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw1\">namespace</span> std <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> type_index<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw1\">class</span> T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> hash<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&gt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> hash<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>type_index<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<h4 id=\"Class_std::type_index\">Class <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/type_index\">std::type_index</a></span></h4>\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"kw1\">namespace</span> std <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> type_index <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"kw1\">public</span><span class=\"sy4\">:</span>\n    type_index<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> type_info<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> rhs<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">==</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> type_index<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> rhs<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> type_index<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> rhs<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> type_index<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> rhs<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;=</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> type_index<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> rhs<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;=</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> type_index<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> rhs<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    strong_ordering operator<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;=&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> type_index<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> rhs<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    size_t hash_code<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">char</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span> name<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n  <span class=\"kw1\">private</span><span class=\"sy4\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> type_info<span class=\"sy2\">*</span> target<span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// exposition only</span>\n    <span class=\"co1\">// Note that the use of a pointer here, rather than a reference,</span>\n    <span class=\"co1\">// means that the default copy/move constructor and assignment</span>\n    <span class=\"co1\">// operators will be provided and work as expected.</span>\n  <span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Synopsis","id":"Synopsis"},{"depth":4,"text":"Class std::type_index","id":"Class_std::type_index"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"header","title":"C++ Standard Library headers"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"Standard library header <typeindex> (C++11)","children":[{"label":"Includes","children":[{"label":"<compare>","note":"Three-way comparison operator support"}]},{"label":"Classes","children":[{"label":"type_index","note":"wrapper around a type_info object, that can be used as index in associative and unordered associative containers"},{"label":"std::hash<std::type_index>","note":"hash support for std::type_index"}]},{"label":"Forward declarations","children":[{"label":"hash","note":"hash function object"}]},{"label":"Synopsis","children":[{"label":"Class std::type_index"}]}]},"standards":["C++11","C++20"],"wordCount":171,"codeBlockCount":2}
